<title>CHILE: Chile Dec fishmeal exports fall to $30.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Chile Dec fishmeal exports fall to $30.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean fishmeal exports fell last month to $30.3 million from $42.6 million in December 1995 and $34.6 million in November, said the Central Bank in its fortnightly report.</p>
<p>Chile's fishmeal exports totaled $627.7 million in 1995. The Bank did not give a total figure for last year in the report.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
